      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### AI Service Health Monitoring\n\nThis dashboard provides a unified view of GPU health and AI service performance across all inference services.\n\n**Services Monitored:** YOLO26, Nemotron (llama.cpp), Florence-2, CLIP, Enrichment (heavy/light)\n\n**Key Indicators:**\n- **GPU OOM Events**: Out-of-memory errors requiring service recovery. Any OOM event is a critical signal.\n- **GPU Memory Utilization**: Per-service VRAM usage as a percentage of available memory.\n- **Service Error Rate**: Rate of failed inference requests per service.\n- **Latency Percentiles**: P50/P95/P99 inference latency to detect degradation.\n\n**Alert Thresholds:** OOM > 0 = Critical | Error rate > 1% = Warning | P95 latency > 2x baseline = Warning"
      },
      "title": "Documentation",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
